        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8caf74d00b649691398546c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我展现何谓刚柔并济的舞蹈吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faca64063eebd3084774734b9c2bc1d1b53067d81a9b3e44880582ed18cbb17b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:387b512029523f6561c55e23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歌艺之道也要全力以赴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a18ad69787c9d6793de22e39e2e176343758512cc9c8c3f6b37e2d144ca2c4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6ad5c9b65a1071b9bb7d039",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们就一起踏上一级战区吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c66df6be565d562b4848c3393847b9fbeda23387d7a3f6beea83f94613afcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08421ed2966cd2e96126559f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没错……遇见训练员前\r\n我一直都很迷惘。不知道该如何\r\n与自己的「烈火」共存。",
      "source_fingerprint": "226b3ca7bf1a13f42faf10d950236c015ca92e596527ce57291471f7e2217916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0cb092da1dfcb9980842076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就等于学生的道服。\r\n穿上后心情也为之一振。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ece869d9c4fdacc036578f2d97d2f2d8808029604ff59935d819c66bb7083906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78410d97242da0ed1d28c81a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，颇具机动性……\r\n穿着这套服装练习「形」也很有趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1539ef7ceb4d69aa62c9cefe00dbfa46dc9a9e68c7480dddeaeeb5c9977f99fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:962d0e4b0133ea61c8d76246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝啊！……穿上这套服装\r\n能感受到彷佛身在道场的心态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6f0d2dfeb6e0f7540bbd00cb37637cc3942f4e477ceab0a629a624c57f8f2de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6280627c64b5f654e907eb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所谓晴奔雨读，\r\n我也想好好注重获取新知。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b610266e05b2f7361119bb0b3e1bcc83c7b0170caf5b8c3d0dbe248f57e6538",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb3b254245207fbf74765252",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞蹈与武术的身体动作有共通之处。\r\n所以站上舞台也是一种武艺的展现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dbd64773e9f9209cc404ae8c758483942b5214bdf86510e144280d27f276f70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:745651ccf5a199fdd8549935",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在道场，黑带跟道服是强者的象征。\r\n我认为决胜服也有同样重大的意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ac8713dd63be7c4f63b242ab5e18d5c9b86e159868b7ed97eafc5a0afbfe380",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b11f864064b0ce984b1d62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甲冑の如し…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c89dfadf3d2a48e76d5153ab6acb890f79c61a5e74d9eb29c7068aeec2430e19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c9d5f139dc285a88f1fac95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "近未来の武士…ですね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ca1652b70420c5d31258fd5e6b5c2ba217dbbd0a2410c0cea13f5a5e4c5d137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45147428b4369f9105de476b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让心情焕然一新，\r\n开始进行日常课题吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cae34a1260507f10ddfd11cd60491d211549e996f68433448d08002f041e69b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e2e6743290d659720502c5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装凌乱正代表心头不稳，\r\n必须注意端正衣冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed3267d7c1fef6ad8097b49462de0e06090694eefeec00f3c740a0fa87d9cc6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43fb4ef031a10aad339a32d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この格好なら踵落としも\r\n回し蹴りも自由自在です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b21dd2bc875fc39764d9eae258a065bced1e65305d47e687078e2eb0061ac30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5efbe5c2c22ac6e927ba63f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『形』をよく見たいのであれば、\r\n上着を脱ぎますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77e8322d5c1f3e446d6532324f89314a3112758d5764972b9abca48ad4e032d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e534f89aef54deb1771744fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就等于学生的道服。\r\n穿上后心情也为之一振。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ece869d9c4fdacc036578f2d97d2f2d8808029604ff59935d819c66bb7083906",
